is the chest measurement.

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:49.870
This is it! This is it! This is it!

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:51.580
They're quoting the bust sizes!

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.520
Nurse's Office

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:58.130
Doctor, Amawa-sensei is here.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.370
Come in.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:00.740
Thank you.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:03.340
And Doctor...

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:05.390
a close, through exam, please.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.040
I'm in your hands.

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:08.650
OK.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.920
Please take your
clothes off over there.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.700
What?! Everything?!

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:15.490
An internal check-up
has also been requested.

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:17.240
Oh, no!

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.910
Now we will find out for certain.

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:25.150
If you're a man...

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:26.810
then I've got you!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.990
87 cm.

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:33.750
Oh my, they've grown again.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.070
Well, yeah, thanks.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.330
Next, Kuzuha-san.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.640
Oh, it's only Kuzuha.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:42.400
Should we even bother?

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:44.300
What's the matter?
We're waiting.

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:47.010
Fuko, don't be embarrassed.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.830
You're still growing.

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:55.850
What are you doing?!

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:57.120
What's the matter, Akira?!

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.300
Time's up.

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:01.480
My dad told me to bring these back
by this afternoon.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.380
Too bad, sorry.

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.730
I feel kind of awkward.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:08.230
I guess bugging the room
was not a good idea.

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:13.020
What's the matter?

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.340
Now I understand their
dislike for physicals.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.270
Amawa-sensei, are you there?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:21.910
Yes?

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:23.770
Could you come with me for a moment?

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:24.410
Yes!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:25.620
I'm saved!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.030
Female Physical Exam Special Room

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:30.860
What happened, Kuzuha?!

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:38.000
You could have been
a bit more discreet.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.520
There are more of you
wearing pads, aren't there?

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.890
I think I understand why you did it.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:54.140
Men's eyes are drawn
to a woman's bust...

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:56.340
and there's nothing
you can do about it.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:58.250
It's almost an instinctive thing...

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.630
so please overlook it?

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.650
I'll apologize for them.

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:04.130
I'm sorry.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.550
But listen, do you really
want to indulge them...

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:11.200
by valuing yourselves in this way?

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.440
Isn't it frustrating?

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:14.790
What counts is not
the size of the breasts...

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:15.950
but what's behind them.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:17.960
Isn't that right?

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.470
You have a heart filled
with many things, Kuzuha...

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.520
and I think it can grow
even bigger over time.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:28.710
Sensei...

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:32.260
I'm sorry.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.180
The same for all of you.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.870
There's no need to wear pads, right?

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:43.670
OK!

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:47.290
Let's take a 10 minute break
and re-take all the measurements.

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:50.890
If you have anything to get rid of,
just do so quietly.

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:53.350
We'll discard all the data
we've taken already.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.400
Yes!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.280
Alright, you only have 10 minutes.
Get moving!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:04.020
Amawa-sensei, please return to
the nurse's office immediately.

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.390
The doctor is waiting.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.370
I thought I was off the hook.

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.090
How stupid.

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:23.940
Fujio-chan!

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:26.060
What should I do with them?

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:28.150
Fuko, you had that many on?!

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.120
Yeah.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.360
Let's throw them away.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.720
Are you ready?

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:40.940
Ah, not yet...

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.410
What are you doing?

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:52.390
Principal, we have
Amawa-sensei's exam results.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:53.680
And?

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:59.800
In excellent health condition.
A young lady with quite a nice body?!

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:02.910
I am not surprised to hear that.

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:05.100
Anyone can see that.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.310
Yes, you are quite right.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.920
I know the doctor, who should've come...

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.690
so I asked him to let
me pose as him.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:17.710
That took a million years off my life.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:21.530
I don't want you to get fired
before you pay the rent, do I?

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:22.960
Thanks for the help.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.800
But you really are
a mystery, Ba-chan.

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:27.960
That had better be a compliment!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.110
Of course!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.840
Gochiso

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:31.740
Shall we, then?

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:32.590
Yeah.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.950
We look perfect, Kochi-san...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.870
Yeah, we look perfect, Mori-chan.

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:46.910
Idiots

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:46.710
You morons, the physicals
are already finished.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.580
But it says here,
it's from three o'clock on?

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:55.890
Kochi-san, it's not "3", it's "13"!

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:57.950
That means one o'clock
in the afternoon!

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.890
My paid vacation day!

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:02.170
Completely
.              hopeless

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:01.930
Sorry...

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.430
You two, I told you to behave!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:05.940
OK!

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:08.020
Yes.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:16.820
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:16.820
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:26.180
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:26.180
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:48.140
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:48.140
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:55.030
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:55.030
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:55.180 --> 00:22:01.880
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:55.180 --> 00:22:01.880
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:09.860
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:09.860
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:16.990
Even if the sky cries

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:16.990
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:25.830
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:25.830
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:53.380
Sixth Period "Fragile Powder Puzzle"

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:42.150
I will conduct the homeroom today,
instead of Amawa-sensei.

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:44.760
The theme is:
the correct techniques for a preview...

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:47.300
that arouses the viewer's interest and expectation.

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:50.090
I will give a demonstration first,
so listen carefully!

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:51.800
Vice-Principal, your time's up.

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:52.920
What?!
